"/arc-plc/ohio/scioto-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids August to September came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. On the middle in 2025, July to August came in at 63% of normal. January to February 2026 is published so far at 44%. Grid 22688 had its driest year in 1987 at 64% of normal.</p>"}
